Package: costdecade
Type: Package
Title: Price Durability by the Decade, Not the Receipt
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("James", "Verlander", email = "scrapertweeter3@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: James Verlander <scrapertweeter3@gmail.com>
Description: A cheap tool replaced three times costs more than the dear one
    bought once, but nobody does that arithmetic at the shelf. costdecade()
    ranks buy-it-for-life candidates by real cost per decade, finds the
    exact lifespan where the dear option starts winning, and totals the
    spend over a full ownership horizon with replacement inflation and
    resale. Companion to the cost-per-decade reviews on DurablePicks
    <https://durablepicks.com>.
